### Fazer login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:40000/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Listar todos os piquetes
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPiquete
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Buscar piquete por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getPiqueteByID/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Cadastrar piquete
POST http://localhost:40000/insertPiquete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "descricao": "Piquete 02",
    "latitude": -10.422,
    "longitude": -49.972,
    "pastoid": 1
}

### Atualizar piquete
PUT http://localhost:40000/updatePiquete/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "descricao": "Piquete 01 Atualizado",
    "latitude": -20.425,
    "longitude": -49.975,
    "pastoid": 1
}

### Excluir piquete
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deletePiquete/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}